#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
/coverage/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# FVM Version Cache
# .fvm/flutter_sdk is the legacy layout. Newer FVM downloads whole SDKs into
# .fvm/versions/ and writes .fvm/version and .fvm/release beside them — none of
# which were ignored, so on the laptop they sat in `git status` as untracked and
# one `git add -A` away from committing an entire Flutter SDK.
.fvm/flutter_sdk
.fvm/versions/
.fvm/version
.fvm/release
